WEBVTT

NOTE week04-clip1-modern-block
NOTE Narration read by an AI-generated voice.
NOTE The clip has its own caption along the bottom of the frame, so these cues
NOTE are placed near the top to keep the two from overlapping.

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.634 line:2 align:center
A large language model in 2026 is
still a stack of decoder blocks,

2
00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:10.940 line:2 align:center
much like the 2017 transformer:
attention, then a feed-forward network,

3
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.150 line:2 align:center
each with a residual connection.

4
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.411 line:2 align:center
The first change is normalization.

5
00:00:17.411 --> 00:00:24.371 line:2 align:center
It now comes before each sublayer
instead of after, and it uses RMS norm,

6
00:00:24.371 --> 00:00:29.750 line:2 align:center
which only rescales each
vector by its root mean square.

7
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:35.804 line:2 align:center
Second, the feed-forward network becomes
swig-loo. The token is projected twice,

8
00:00:35.804 --> 00:00:39.441 line:2 align:center
and one projection passes
through a smooth activation

9
00:00:39.441 --> 00:00:42.750 line:2 align:center
and acts as a gate on the other.

10
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:46.600 line:2 align:center
Third, positions are no
longer added at the input.

11
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.770 line:2 align:center
Instead, RoPE rotates every query
and key inside each attention layer,

12
00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.350 line:2 align:center
as we saw in week two.

13
00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:00.103 line:2 align:center
Fourth, attention becomes grouped-query
attention. In the small Qwen3 model,

14
00:01:00.103 --> 00:01:04.961 line:2 align:center
16 query heads share
8 key and value heads,

15
00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:08.417 line:2 align:center
which saves memory during generation.

16
00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:15.325 line:2 align:center
The overall shape is unchanged.
The 2017 decoder stacked 6 blocks,

17
00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:18.449 line:2 align:center
the small Qwen3 model stacks 28,

18
00:01:18.449 --> 00:01:23.247 line:2 align:center
and the last block feeds the
prediction of the next token.
